WEBVTT

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:46.840
It's too late to be
looking for a job now...

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.870
"Preschool Teachers'
Certification Exam"?

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:00.710
I think this year's
exam is over.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:02.590
Guess who?!

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.320
I know that voice. Yagami.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:10.140
Don't scare me like that.

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:11.930
Sorry!

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.160
What are you doing here?

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:16.390
I came to buy some
reference books.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.930
What are you doing
here, Mr. Godai?

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:21.000
N-Nothing, really.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:42.460
So you still haven't
gotten a job yet?

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.720
No. Things have come up.

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:50.390
But don't worry.
This is just the beginning.

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:52.660
But haven't all
the reputable firms

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:55.110
already chosen
their new hires?

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:58.610
Why don't I ask my father
one more time and.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:02:59.470
No.

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:02.620
Don't do that.

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:05.520
I told you, I'm going to choose
my own path to my future.

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:07.340
- But.
- Don't worry.

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:09.940
It's one of those things
that you just can't rush.

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:11.560
I just have to be patient.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.360
Are you planning to become
a preschool teacher?

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.690
At the book store,
you were.

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:25.240
I was just looking.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.370
Oh, no! Look at the time!

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:31.900
I-I'm sorry, but
I gotta go. Sorry.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.150
Mr. Godai?!

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.650
Thank you very much.

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.340
Come in! Come in!

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:45.710
Take advantage of
our special offer!

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:47.490
Sir, how about it?

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.830
For Just 3,OOO yen,
enjoy our pretty young girls!

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:00.400
You're gettin' pretty good.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.140
Y-You're here again..?

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:05.340
Sure. We're gonna help
this place make money.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:09.400
Don't mind us.
We'll help ourselves.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:10.780
I'm ready to drink!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.050
Won't you be
my Sugar Daddy?!

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.100
Sugar Daddy?

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:22.570
He can't. He's unemployed
and has no income.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:25.030
Please! Let's Just say
my employment is a mystery.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:28.360
I don't care.
Please be my Daddy.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:30.900
Why not? Be a man.

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:32.640
Please!

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:35.080
Your eyes tell me
you're Serious.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:36.730
Yes. I am.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.250
God is calling me!

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:50.390
Are you okay with this?

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:52.480
If they keep sponging
off you every night,

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:54.960
you'll never be
able pay off your tab.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.980
My hands are tied.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.590
I don't know what
they got on you,

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:06.030
but you should get rid
of bums like that

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:07.730
for your own good.

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:11.010
'Scuse me!

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:26.690
Hi. Are you going out?

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:28.050
Yes.

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:31.290
You look worn out.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.030
Me? Not really.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.650
You've got a lot
on your plate.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.940
Your preschool job
and your job hunt.

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:44.820
Y-Yes. I'm on my way to see
my career counselor again.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.460
Good luck.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:50.750
I'm sure you'll find
a great job for yourself.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.610
Thanks. Bye.

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:58.480
Sir! Come on in! Take advantage
of our special offer!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.910
Mrs. Ichinose?

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:00.590
Bye!

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:04.160
We'll see you again tonight!

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.070
You're a pal!

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:06.190
Bye.

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.010
What are you talking about?

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.960
Nothing.

00:06:22.890 --> 00:06:26.610
I can't tell Manager that
I'm working at a cabaret

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:29.710
because I didn't have enough
money to pay the bill there.

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:42.530
No pushing!
Wait your turn, okay?

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.750
Are you sure you don't want
to be a preschool teacher?

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:53.670
The other day, the
principal was saying.

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:58.730
Godai' has been
such a great help.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:02.840
He loves children,
and the parents like him.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.630
Godai would make a
great preschool teacher.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.050
He was singing your praises.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:10.500
Really?

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:14.030
Maybe I'd be good at
this kind of work.

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:16.660
Yes. You'd be so great.

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:17.890
You think so?

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:23.840
Mr. Godai, let's play
in the sand box!

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:25.510
Come on, Mr. Godai! Hurry!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:26.780
Come on!

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:28.380
Okay. Okay.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:32.780
Preschool teacher...
It's not a bad idea.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:36.450
What? You want to quit?!

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.920
Are you serious?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:44.650
Yes. I need to find a career,
and I can't keep working here

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:48.230
at a time when I need to
find direction in my life.

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:51.780
O-Of course, I promise
to pay the tab.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:03.340
You're a respectable
young man!

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:06.380
You've made a good decision.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.760
As long as those bozos
sponge off you every night,

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:12.340
you'll never be able
to pay your tab.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:13.890
Yeah.

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:16.050
It's too bad,

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.400
now that you've become
pretty good at your job.

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:20.980
but I understand this
is for your own good.

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:22.530
Thank you.

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.440
Well, I think
I can trust you.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.030
I'll talk to the boss myself.

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:30.930
Just be sure to pay off
your tab, all right?

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:31.700
Yes!

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:34.010
Hey.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.850
Where's the babysitter lady?

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:39.990
She called and said that
she threw her back out

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.350
and won't be able
to come for a while.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:45.450
No way! I have to get
ready to work soon.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.950
My baby won't stop crying.
What am I supposed to do?

00:08:48.030 --> 00:08:50.870
Don't ask me.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:53.400
All right, all right.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.380
Maybe his diaper's wet.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.000
How do you know that?

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.070
You're soaking wet.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.150
Of course you
don't feel good.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.900
Here. Let's change you.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.670
You're good.

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:12.830
You got a kid at home?

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:15.280
N-NO I don't!

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:17.950
Will you watch my kids, too?

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:19.750
Come.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:20.530
Go.

00:09:23.530 --> 00:09:24.630
What's your name?

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:25.680
Taro.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:28.200
And this one's Hanako.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:31.950
I wish they didn't look
exactly like my ex-husband.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:33.900
Isn't that how it always is?

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:35.300
It's a bummer.

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:38.190
Hey!

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:42.350
This is his last day here,

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:44.140
but you can play
with him today.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.220
You're leaving?

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.170
Yes.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.780
He's gotta look
for a career.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:51.980
Oh.

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:53.860
Too bad for us.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.700
When the neon starts
lighting up the town,

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.900
my feet just
bring me this way.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.030
Let's party hard
again tonight.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:11.170
Hey!

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:17.170
Oh, good evening. Where are
you all off to, tonight?

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.410
To your shop, of course.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:23.310
I see. Well, have a good time.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:25.070
Huh?

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:31.280
By the way, my tab's
not open anymore.

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:35.650
Did Godai quit his job?

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:45.740
I'm home.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:48.440
Hello.

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:49.610
Hi.

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.170
You're earlier
than usual tonight.

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:53.650
Y-Yes.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:58.150
How did it go today?

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:00.890
With you career counselor?

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:03.490
W-Well

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:06.400
I'm sorry.
I didn't mean to..

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.530
It's okay.

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:18.480
I haven't decided yet,
so I can't say for sure, but.

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:23.930
Since I love kids,

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:27.120
I might Iike to have a job
like I do now

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:28.720
where I can be with them.

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:31.950
So you want to be
a preschool teacher?

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:34.280
I'm not sure.

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:38.130
I think you'd be great at it.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:44.640
We're home!

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.010
Welcome back.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:48.700
Boy, was it heavy.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:51.250
What're you two doing here?

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.830
Huh? N-Nothing.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:58.880
Whatever. Let's drink up!

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:02.310
We must drink freely to forget
we used to drink free.

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.320
Godai, bring the beer, will you?

00:12:04.470 --> 00:12:06.450
Manager, you join us.

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.600
No thank you.

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.030
C'mon!

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.000
Good luck,
preschool teacher!

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:21.830
Manager!

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:22.850
Yes!

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:29.350
Manager...

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:54.160
Hello? Otonashi speaking.

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:58.480
Godai's grandmother?
How are you?

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:00.350
How's eveyone?

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:06.440
I just called because
something's bothering me.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:08.490
Last night, I had a dream

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:12.150
that Yusaku was weeping
because he was hungry.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:15.080
Is he eating all right?

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:17.230
I think so.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.600
Won't you please
keep an eye on him

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.160
every once in a while?

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:24.660
Sure. I'll do that.
Don't worry.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.370
Well, take care.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.440
Thank you.
Good-bye.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.490
He's been
very busy lately,

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:47.150
and he hasn't been
looking so great.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.130
I wonder if
he's been eating?

00:13:58.540 --> 00:13:59.900
Now, you try.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:02.070
Don't suck it in.
You blow, okay?

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:05.900
They're flying!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:06.910
My turn!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.930
Wait your turn.

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:13.120
Preschool teacher, huh?

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:16.520
Godai!?

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:17.360
Yes?

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.390
The principal
wants to see you.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:24.020
The principal?
I wonder what he wants?

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:35.330
If he asks me to stay,

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:37.430
maybe I can work here
after graduation

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.800
and take the next
certification exam.

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:45.390
I wouldn't mind
staying here to work.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:49.410
Come in.

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:51.720
Excuse me!

00:14:53.430 --> 00:15:00.060
Godai, you've been
such a great help.

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:01.870
Thank you.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:07.400
I love kids. Maybe this is
just the kind of job for me.

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:15.540
I'm sorry this work has been
such an imposition on you.

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:20.650
I was finally able to hire
a new preschool teacher.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:25.810
You're free to devote your time
to your job hunt from tomorrow.

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:29.150
I'm sure you'll find
a great job somewhere.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:33.530
Here's your pay
through today.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:36.290
Godai?

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:38.970
Thank you.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.940
MR. GODAI

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:57.410
The bubbles flew to the roof!

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:05.220
They flew to the roof,
burst, and disappeared.

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:12.370
I'm late!

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:18.380
Oh yeah. I don't
have to go anymore.

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:25.350
I just have
the worst luck.

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:32.520
Yes?!

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:33.420
Godai?

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:38.420
Good morning.

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:40.690
Were you still sleeping?

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:44.060
Here. Your lunch.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.300
L-Lunch?

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.780
Your grandmother
called yesterday.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:51.870
She thought maybe
you weren't eating.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:53.200
Grandma?

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:55.280
Looking for a job
is a lot of work.

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:57.400
You have to get
your nutrition.

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:00.120
Here. Please eat it
at your preschool.

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:01.280
B-But

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.450
You better hurry,
or you'll be late.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:05.550
Yes.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:07.520
Good luck.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.820
Thanks. Bye!

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:14.490
Where am I supposed to go?

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.600
It's nice and warm,
isn't it?

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.920
No thanks.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:44.120
Manager, I got
laid off at preschool.

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:49.530
Is that right?
How wonderful

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:10.610
I bet the kids would have
gotten a kick out of this.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:16.430
This came out so cute.

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:18.970
I bet the kids
are loving it.

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:22.470
I think I'll make a
penguin out of a wiener!

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.100
H-He's gone?

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:34.250
Yes. A new teacher
started today.

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.500
I see.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:45.840
Shucks. I wanted to talk
to Mr. Godai one more time.

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:49.850
I don't want to
phone Maison Ikkoku.

00:18:50.970 --> 00:18:51.850
Phone...?

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:17.780
They flew to the roof,
burst, and disappeared.

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:24.160
I better go
pay off that tab.

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:30.530
Mr. Ioka!

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.800
Hey, Godai! You came to
pay off that tab already?

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.940
I just got paid,

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:38.740
so I thought I'd better
pay before I use it up.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.520
Admirable.

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:43.680
What's with that boy?

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:45.600
This one?

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.960
The babysitter lady quits,
and this is what happens.

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:51.190
It suits you.

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:53.160
Idiot!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:59.960
All right, all right.
I can't work like this.

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:03.970
Are you hungry,
or are you wet?

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.120
What's the matter?

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:08.070
You look like you've got
some time on your hands.

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.780
You're--?!

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:19.520
I called your college
and they gave me your address.

00:20:19.890 --> 00:20:21.320
I see.

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:25.160
Thank you very much
for your help.

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:27.430
How has Director Yagami been?

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:29.620
I've been meaning to visit
to formally thank him for.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:32.390
I came to ask you
about Mr. Godai.

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:33.240
Godai?

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:35.330
Would you wait
a minute, please?

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:38.670
Who is it?

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:39.970
Nobody

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:44.950
Here.

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:48.570
He should be there now.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.870
Would you tell him
that I owe him one?

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:54.600
Thank you.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.540
"Owe him one"?

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.890
Open up!

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:07.000
Good boy.

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:11.500
You must really love kids.

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:16.120
Well, I'm working-- I was
working as a preschool teacher.

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:18.470
Preschool teacher?

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:24.180
So there really ARE men who
like taking care of kids.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.880
I'm so impressed.

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:28.820
Please.

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:31.520
Don't forget to chew, okay?

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:35.580
So are you going to
be a preschool teacher?

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:38.460
well, I...

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:43.240
Godai, the money you
gave me earlier.

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:46.670
It won't cover the tab that
those three bozos racked up.

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:47.470
Huh?

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:50.780
The boss says that
if you'd work for us,

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:52.890
he's willing to give you
a break on that tab.

00:21:53.260 --> 00:21:54.140
What do you say?

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:57.640
Do you have another
job right now?

00:21:57.730 --> 00:21:58.450
No.

00:21:58.730 --> 00:21:59.840
Then it's been decided!

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:01.610
Help me bring in
some customers.

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:02.380
Um..

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:06.380
If those three show up again,
I'll set 'em straight.

00:22:06.470 --> 00:22:07.890
Leave it to me.

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:09.620
M-Mr. Ioka!

00:22:13.270 --> 00:22:16.700
I Just can't get into it.

00:22:16.780 --> 00:22:19.830
I miss going to the cabaret
every night.

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:23.070
Nothing is as memorable
as the taste of free booze.

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:31.070
Let's force ourselves
to party tonight!

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.550
There they go again.

00:22:41.060 --> 00:22:43.820
I wonder if Godai will
be late again tonight?

00:22:54.110 --> 00:22:55.950
"Cabaret Bunny..."

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:56.710
Bunny...

00:22:57.950 --> 00:22:59.440
Come in! Come in!

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:02.750
Come in. Please come in.

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:04.910
Come in! Welcome!

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:06.720
Have you forgotten?

00:23:07.960 --> 00:23:09.610
Our company motto.

00:23:09.970 --> 00:23:14.770
To draw in customers,
we must smile and articulate.

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:18.620
To draw in customers,
We must smile and articulate!

00:23:18.970 --> 00:23:20.050
That's right!

00:23:20.300 --> 00:23:23.240
We're the golden duo
together again!

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:25.240
Let's do it again!

00:23:25.450 --> 00:23:29.780
Come in and experience
paradise at a special price!

00:23:30.520 --> 00:23:32.840
Is this what you meant

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:35.100
by choosing your own
path to your future?

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:38.540
Come in! Come in, sir!

00:23:38.660 --> 00:23:42.180
3,OOO yen only!
Limited time offer!

00:23:42.260 --> 00:23:44.040
Sir! Sir!

00:23:44.120 --> 00:23:46.220
Hey! Sir!

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:50.650
She found out?!

00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:52.880
She knows about the preschool
and the cabaret.

00:23:52.970 --> 00:23:55.460
Of course Manager
would be mad.

00:23:55.590 --> 00:23:57.580
And that Yagami...

00:23:58.440 --> 00:23:59.930
...at the cabaret?!

00:24:00.010 --> 00:24:03.860
Next: "Godai Goes Ga-Ga!
Yagami's a Bunny Girl Now?!"

00:24:04.070 --> 00:24:06.860
High school girls nowadays
are way out there!
